{"time": 1764165208, "type": "recv", "message_id": "1771075948", "deleted": false, "dect": {"host_id": null, "group_id": "1098529435", "user_id": "1040972910"}, "sender": {"id": "1040972910", "name": "划船不靠桨の233"}, "message": "喷水池"}
{"time": 1764165255, "type": "recv", "message_id": "113650144", "deleted": false, "dect": {"host_id": null, "group_id": "1098529435", "user_id": "1040972910"}, "sender": {"id": "1040972910", "name": "划船不靠桨の233"}, "message": "虽然外面很热，里面却很凉快"}
{"time": 1764165334, "type": "recv", "message_id": "2010630582", "deleted": false, "dect": {"host_id": null, "group_id": "1098529435", "user_id": "1040972910"}, "sender": {"id": "1040972910", "name": "划船不靠桨の233"}, "message": "宽敞的门口却只有半个门板，上半是一个大架子，越过这道门就是通往凉爽舒适的旅舍的道路。门楣上铺着破烂的窗帘。房间里只有几张空无一物的桌子和一扇狭窄的横闩门。"}
{"time": 1764165347, "type": "recv", "message_id": "1952023058", "deleted": false, "dect": {"host_id": null, "group_id": "1098529435", "user_id": "1040972910"}, "sender": {"id": "1040972910", "name": "划船不靠桨の233"}, "message": "+1斩首弯刀"}
